title Vinyl: where nothing can change the volume, at 640x480 (the group shows --, its "+" says so in a notice) and the notice over the seek row
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_NOVOLUME 1

wait 1200
expect esc
expect text "--"
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 01-now-volume-unavailable
expect text "Volume is not available on this board"
expect noquit
